// [user 2026-08-18] FINISH STRIP (design: _research/skin_selector_plan.md). One row of fixed
// buttons carries every skin finish for every gun - variants never get tiles. Buttons fire the
// archived commit gate (vstr coop_loFcmt<fid>) exactly as tiles fire coop_loCmt<id>; padlocks
// are enabledcvar coop_loLkFV<fid>, fail-locked by lkfin.cfg until the server's archived
// export corrects them. [2026-08-21 bug-2026] Strip moved +11 (y423->434): helmNameLbl ends at
// y431 and the strip started at 423, so a two-line skin/helm name ran INTO the finish buttons
// (user screenshot). 434 clears the name; overlapping the fit-mode rows below is the accepted
// original design - the strip predates its move and sat over them at y456 too. Stale y456 note:
// so it draws over) shares this band. STANDARD has no padlock - always available.
